---
layout: base.njk
title: Punjab Data Project
permalink: /research/punjab/
---
{% from "github.njk" import githubButton %}
<article class="py-16">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-4xl tracking-tight uppercase font-bold text-white mb-6" style="letter-spacing: 0.1em;">Punjab Data Project</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mb-2">A computational sociological analysis of British Punjab through the imperial print register, 1867–1942.</p>
    <p class="text-gray-500 mb-12">With Prof. Emmett Davis.</p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-12">
      {% for n, label in [["4,502", "Entries"], ["6,944,051", "Registered copies"], ["1910–1912", "Twelve quarters"], ["2,076", "Printers and publishers"]] %}
      <div class="bg-[var(--color-bg-card)] border border-[var(--color-border)] p-6 rounded-lg text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">{{ n }}</p>
        <p class="text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider text-xs mt-1">{{ label }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a href="https://tgraves719.github.io/Punjab-Data-Project/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="sound-interactive interactive-rainbow px-6 py-3 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-lg">Explorer</a>
      {{ githubButton("https://github.com/tgraves719/Punjab-Data-Project") }}
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
